 'book-open':'<path d="M12 7v14M3 18V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4 4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z"/>',
